WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.760
You're writing an essay in French,

2
00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:03.910
and you need the reason why.

3
00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:06.650
You know «la raison», the reason.

4
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.980
You know «pourquoi», why.

5
00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.190
Can you just put them side by side?

6
00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:13.460
Next line: what I need.

7
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:15.050
You know «j'ai besoin».

8
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.720
But which little words go in front of it?

9
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.590
Word for word looks reasonable.

10
00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:21.640
It doesn't always sound French.

11
00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.110
So how do French writers
say these without sounding

12
00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:25.870
like a translation app?

13
00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.030
In this mission, you'll
fill a slot that has

14
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:29.420
no noun in it.

15
00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.580
Then you'll switch nouns
and prepositions in the lab.

16
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:36.910
Your mission: find the French that
sounds French, not translated.
